INT. CARRACLOUGH FARM - DAY

The sun rises over the rolling hills of the Carraclough farm. Lassie, a loyal Rough Collie, runs around the farm, exploring every nook and cranny. Timmy, her young master, plays with her, laughing and throwing sticks for her to catch.

As they play, Lassie's loyalty and bond with Timmy grow stronger. She sniffs around the farm, taking in the familiar sights and smells.

Suddenly, Timmy's mother calls out from the kitchen window. "Timmy, come help me with the chores!"

Timmy reluctantly says goodbye to Lassie and heads towards the house. Lassie decides to explore the farm further, completing a task and strengthening her bond with Timmy.

As Lassie explores, she finds a clue that might aid her journey. She decides to head to the village to gather more information.

