On the other side, she sees the train preparing to depart. Lassie sprints towards the train, her heart racing with excitement. She manages to jump aboard just as the train starts moving.

As the train chugs along the tracks, Lassie catches her breath and looks out the window. She sees the countryside rolling by and feels a sense of excitement and trepidation. She is one step closer to reuniting with Timmy.

The train eventually pulls into a station near the Carraclough farm. Lassie disembarks and begins the final leg of her journey, her tail wagging with excitement.

